      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 2 years 2 weeks ago",
      "body": "Hello mothers to be,\nMy name is Romani and I am a Masters Student at University College London (UCL) and Anna Freud.\nI am conducting a 5 minute anonymous survey on well-being and perceived social support in pregnancy.\nThis project consists of completing a short online questionnaire anonymously. This study is being done to understand how well-being may change in certain pregnancy trimesters and if social support interventions can be the answer to preventing declines in well-being during pregnancy and mental illness.\nThere is a chance to win a £25 online voucher for participating in the survey. Completing the survey would be much appreciated.\nPlease email romani.reid.23@ucl.ac.uk if you wish to take part in this 5 minute questionnaire.\nOnce again, congrats on your pregnancy!",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-11964/#93423",
